# =============================================================================
# FLOOD RISK PROJECT — .gitignore
# TechCrush C8 Capstone
# =============================================================================
# RULE: Only source code, notebooks, docs, and small CSVs/PNGs go to GitHub.
# Raw geospatial downloads and large binary files are regenerated by the pipeline.
# =============================================================================

# ── Raw Downloaded Data (auto-generated by Stage 3 pipeline) ────────────────
data/

# ── Large Output Rasters & Shapefiles ───────────────────────────────────────
outputs/maps/flood_susceptibility.tif

# ── Serialized ML Models (can be retrained from pipeline) ───────────────────
outputs/models/*.joblib
outputs/models/*.pkl
outputs/models/*.pickle

# ── Python Cache & Bytecode ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyo
.Python

# ── Virtual Environments ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
venv/
env/
.venv/
.env/

# ── Jupyter Notebook Checkpoints ────────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── OS Files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── IDE / Editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Temporary & Scratch Files ───────────────────────────────────────────────
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log

# ── Large Zip Archives ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip

# =============================================================================
# WHAT IS TRACKED (kept in git):
#   app.py                    — Streamlit demonstration dashboard
#   requirements.txt          — Python dependency specification
#   flood_risk_pipeline.py    — Master pipeline script (Stages 1-18)
#   flood_risk_pipeline.ipynb — Jupyter Notebook
#   build_pipeline.py         — Notebook generator
#   patch_pipeline.py         — Patch utility
#   evaluate_diagnostics.py   — Evaluation helper script
#   download_wheels.py        — Offline wheel downloader
#   README.md                 — Project documentation
#   CORRECTION_LOG.md         — Audit log
#   EXPERIMENT_MANIFEST.md    — Experiment manifest
#   outputs/figures/          — Generated evaluation plots (PNGs)
#   outputs/maps/*.html       — Interactive Folium map
#   outputs/maps/*.png        — Static susceptibility map
#   outputs/*.csv             — Decision log, model comparison, limitations
#   outputs/project_metadata.json
# =============================================================================
